it is official the conservatorship of  bernie spears has been terminated  after 13 years the conservatorship which  has ruled over britney spears life and  finances has finally come to an end so  how did we get to this pivotal moment  and what happens now  in november 2006 britney spears filed  for divorce from her then-husband and  the father of her two children kevin  fedeline  the following year spears one of the  biggest stars in the world suffered a  very public mental health breakdown  up until this point britney's image had  been carefully controlled  am i a virgin  in 2007 shortly after entering rehab for  drug abuse spears walked into a los  angeles hair salon and shaved her head  in february 2008 the 26 year old singer  was taken to hospital for a psychiatric  evaluation for the second time this is  when britney's father jamie spears asked  a los angeles court to put britney in a  temporary emergency conservatorship  later that year a judge extended  contemporary conservatorship  indefinitely  [Music]  britney's conservatorship was split into  two parts one for her estate so her home  her credit card her finances and the  other for her person so her health and  well-being when britney's  conservatorship was granted in 2008 a  judge said that it was in britney's best  interests and stated that britney was  susceptible to undue influence  it meant that britney's father jamie was  given the legal right to make decisions  regarding his daughter's finances health  business deals and personal life britney  was stripped of her rights  a conservatorship is granted by a court  for individuals who are unable to make  their own decisions so those for  instance who are suffering with dementia  or another mental illness it's intended  for those who cannot take care of  themselves  [Music]  the free britney movement was formed by  britney spears fans who were concerned  about the true nature of her  conservatorship and wanted the singer to  be free  fans began to look for clues as to how  britney might be feeling in her  instagram photos and videos  next question is am i okay yes i'm  totally fine  i'm taking a break right now because um  i'm enjoying myself  while it's been going on for several  years now the free britney movement  gained real momentum in 2021 thanks to a  documentary to unsealed court documents  and britney's own testimony  britney's thanked the movement for  raising awareness of her conservatorship  battle and even posted this video with  fiance samasgari  after years of near silence on the issue  earlier this year britney spears issued  a 24-minute statement against the  conservatorship in her testimony she  said that her father and others forced  her to work tirelessly she compared her  seven day a week working schedule to  slavery since the establishment of her  conservatorship britney has released  four albums she's been a judge on the  second season of the x factor and  performed for four years in a hit las  vegas residency  britney spears told a u.s judge she's  been prevented from getting married or  having children and has been prescribed  medication against her will she called  the arrangement abusive and said she was  traumatized  not only is this momentous for brittany  but she helped shine a light  on conservatorships and guardianships  from coast to coast  britney's lawyer has vowed to  investigate britney's father for alleged  financial misdeeds he questions how much  money jamie has received from the  conservatorship since the arrangement  began  jamie spears says he has nothing to hide  regarding his administration of  britney's estate and will therefore hide  nothing  he maintains that he loves his daughter  wants to protect her and her best  interests he says he has never abused  her  while this is a key moment it's not the  final chapter in this story britney  spears lawyer has vowed to fight to find  the full depths of how her  conservatorship operated for so long  [Music]  [Applause]  [Music]
 

